BT /F1 11 Tf 15 TL 40 740 Td (Computer vision jobs for freshers in the UK: where the demand comes from) Tj T* () Tj T* (Computer vision engineers are hired wherever a camera replaces a human eye. In) Tj T* (the UK, typical employers include makers of driver assistance and autonomous) Tj T* (vehicle systems, factories that inspect products on a production line, retailers) Tj T* (that count customers and track stock, health technology firms that read medical) Tj T* (images, and drone and security companies that watch large sites. Graduate roles) Tj T* (often carry titles such as graduate machine learning engineer, junior computer) Tj T* (vision engineer or research assistant.) Tj ET
endstream
