BT /F1 11 Tf 15 TL 40 740 Td (Skills UK employers ask for from new graduates) Tj T* () Tj T* (Job adverts for graduate computer vision roles usually ask for strong Python,) Tj T* (experience with PyTorch or TensorFlow, and practical use of OpenCV. Employers) Tj T* (like to see object detection and tracking work with models from the YOLO family.) Tj T* (Teams that ship products also want deployment skills, such as exporting a model) Tj T* (to ONNX, running it on a small device, and measuring its speed. Knowing how to) Tj T* (evaluate a model honestly matters as much as training it. A degree in computer) Tj T* (science, engineering, mathematics or a related field is the usual starting) Tj T* (point, and a master's degree in AI is common among applicants.) Tj ET
endstream
