BT /F1 11 Tf 15 TL 40 740 Td (How freshers stand out, and the right to work) Tj T* () Tj T* (Entry level roles attract many applicants, so evidence counts. A public project) Tj T* (with a clear README, measured results and an honest list of limits shows more) Tj T* (than a list of course certificates. Candidates who explain what failed, and how) Tj T* (they tested it, are easier to trust. A short demo that a recruiter can run in) Tj T* (minutes helps too. International graduates should check each advert for the) Tj T* (right to work in the UK, because some employers cannot offer visa sponsorship) Tj T* (and say so in the advert.) Tj ET
endstream
